178
00:09:59,364 --> 00:10:04,642
Saya ingin ke tempat yang bisa makan seafood enak dan suasananya tenang.

179
00:10:04,666 --> 00:10:07,884
Kalau begitu, bagaimana kalau ke Kanazawa?

180
00:10:07,908 --> 00:10:10,141
Kanazawa?

181
00:10:10,165 --> 00:10:12,298
